{
  "schema": "agent-contract.prepare-envelope-vectors/v1",
  "spec": [
    "Envelope = {schema, runId, tool, role, payload, payloadDigest, expiresAt, nonce, serverKeyId, serverSig}.",
    "payloadDigest = canonicalDigest(payload) (0x + sha256 hex of canonical JSON; see agent-contract.canonical-digest-vectors/v1).",
    "signedMessage = UTF-8 bytes of canonicalJson(envelope without serverSig).",
    "serverSig = {alg: 'ed25519', keyId, sig: 0x + 64-byte hex}; ed25519 over signedMessage.",
    "A verifier MUST: check schema, recompute payloadDigest, check expiresAt > now, check nonce unused (per runId), then verify serverSig against the pinned server public key for keyId.",
    "The role then signs payloadDigest (N5); that role-signature scheme is N5's, not this file's."
  ],
